```

Y en `acquire_sync`, dos loops de busy-wait reales:
```rust
// modo legacy (sin rechazo):
loop {
    if self.sem.try_take().is_ok() { return Ok(self.admit(t0)); }
    std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(5));
}
